@startuml
title FR-22 - View Saved Forecast - Activity Diagram

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam conditionStyle InsideDiamond

|Blood Bank Administrator|
start
:Request saved forecasts;

|Server — Analytics & AI|
:Retrieve saved forecasts available within\nthe administrator's current scope;

if (The forecast list was\nretrieved successfully?) then (Yes)

  if (Saved forecasts exist\nwithin the permitted scope?) then (Yes)
    |Client|
    :Display the available saved forecasts;

    |Blood Bank Administrator|
    :Select a saved forecast;

    |Client|
    :Clear previously displayed forecast details;

    |Server — Analytics & AI|
    :Retrieve the exact selected saved result\nand its identifying information\nwithin the current permitted scope;

    if (The exact selected forecast is\navailable, in scope and readable?) then (Yes)
      |Client|
      :Display its saved component, ABO/Rh,\nscope, identifying information and results;
    else (No)
      |Client|
      :Report that the selected forecast\ncannot be displayed;
    endif

  else (No)
    |Client|
    :Display no saved forecast results;
  endif

else (No)
  |Client|
  :Report that saved forecasts\ncould not be loaded;
endif

stop
@enduml